            <p class="text-body en-only" style="margin: 0 auto;">フサム | experience™ is a concept house and strategic lab focused on Human Experience Engineering.<br><br>We operate at the intersection of psychology, sensory design, and cinematic translation to transform interaction into memory. Where traditional marketing ends, experience architecture begins..<br><br><span style="color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 500;">This is not marketing.. This is experience architecture.</span></p>
